    "description": "Guide title."
  },
  "guideCaptureLead": "Get it out of your head first; decide later.",
  "@guideCaptureLead": {
    "description": "Guide lead sentence."
  },
  "guideCapture1Title": "Tap + anywhere",
  "@guideCapture1Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideCapture1Body": "The capture button is on every tab. Write one line and press Enter; the field stays open for the next thought.",
  "@guideCapture1Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideCapture2Title": "Paste a brain-dump",
  "@guideCapture2Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideCapture2Body": "Paste several lines at once and each line becomes its own item.",
  "@guideCapture2Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideCapture3Title": "Share from other apps",
  "@guideCapture3Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideCapture3Body": "Share text from a message or a web page to Clearing to capture it.",
  "@guideCapture3Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideCapture4Title": "From your home screen",
  "@guideCapture4Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideCapture4Body": "Add the quick-capture widget: long-press the home screen, then Widgets › Clearing.",
  "@guideCapture4Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideDecideTitle": "Deciding what things mean",
  "@guideDecideTitle": {
    "description": "Guide title."
  },
  "guideDecideLead": "Every thought in the Inbox gets a place, in a few taps.",
  "@guideDecideLead": {
    "description": "Guide lead sentence."
  },
  "guideDecide1Title": "Clarify step by step",
  "@guideDecide1Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideDecide1Body": "Tap an Inbox item. Clearing asks: is it actionable, what’s the next action, is someone else doing it, and when?",
  "@guideDecide1Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideDecide2Title": "Swipe shortcuts",
  "@guideDecide2Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideDecide2Body": "Swipe right for Today or This week; swipe left to pick a date, keep it for Someday, or delete it.",
  "@guideDecide2Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideDecide3Title": "Done means…",
  "@guideDecide3Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideDecide3Body": "For anything vague, write what finished looks like, and break it into steps.",
  "@guideDecide3Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideDecide4Title": "Waiting on someone",
  "@guideDecide4Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideDecide4Body": "If someone else is doing it, note who, and when to follow up.",
  "@guideDecide4Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideTodayTitle": "Today and must-dos",
  "@guideTodayTitle": {
    "description": "Guide title."
  },
  "guideTodayLead": "Today shows what you planned for today, and keeps it small.",
  "@guideTodayLead": {
    "description": "Guide lead sentence."
  },
  "guideToday1Title": "Must-dos",
  "@guideToday1Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideToday1Body": "Star up to three things that truly must happen. Everything else stays visible below.",
  "@guideToday1Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideToday2Title": "Carried over",
  "@guideToday2Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideToday2Body": "Things from earlier days wait quietly at the bottom. Nothing turns red.",
  "@guideToday2Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideToday3Title": "This week",
  "@guideToday3Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideToday3Body": "Things for this week, without a day, gather in one row.",
  "@guideToday3Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideToday4Title": "Done, and undo",
  "@guideToday4Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideToday4Body": "Tap the ring when done. Changed your mind? Tap Undo, or untick it in Lists › Done.",
  "@guideToday4Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideTimeTitle": "Dates, reminders and repeats",
  "@guideTimeTitle": {
    "description": "Guide title."
  },
  "guideTimeLead": "When you’ll do it, when it’s due, and when to be reminded are three separate things.",
  "@guideTimeLead": {
    "description": "Guide lead sentence."
  },
  "guideTime1Title": "Do on, deadline, remind me",
  "@guideTime1Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideTime1Body": "“When” is the day you plan to do it. A deadline is when it’s due. A reminder is a notification; you can have up to three.",
  "@guideTime1Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideTime2Title": "Repeats",
  "@guideTime2Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideTime2Body": "Daily, weekly or monthly, or counted from when you finish (good for haircuts). Missed repeats never pile up.",
  "@guideTime2Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideTime3Title": "Quiet hours",
  "@guideTime3Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideTime3Body": "Early reminders wait until morning; ones you timed exactly still arrive.",
  "@guideTime3Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideTime4Title": "Morning summary",
  "@guideTime4Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideTime4Body": "Turn on one note each morning with today’s must-dos, in Settings › Reminders.",
  "@guideTime4Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideReviewTitle": "Reviews and resets",
  "@guideReviewTitle": {
    "description": "Guide title."
  },
  "guideReviewLead": "Two short routines that keep your head clear.",
  "@guideReviewLead": {
    "description": "Guide lead sentence."
  },
  "guideReview1Title": "Weekly review",
  "@guideReview1Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideReview1Body": "About 15 minutes: empty your head, sort the Inbox, look back at last week and ahead at the next.",
  "@guideReview1Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideReview2Title": "Overwhelm reset",
  "@guideReview2Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideReview2Body": "When it’s all too much, five quick steps narrow everything down to one thing.",
  "@guideReview2Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideReview3Title": "Focus",
  "@guideReview3Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideReview3Body": "Shows a single item and nothing else, until it’s done.",
  "@guideReview3Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideReview4Title": "Print a worksheet",
  "@guideReview4Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideReview4Body": "Print today or this week on one page, with room to write.",
  "@guideReview4Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideOrganizeTitle": "Lists, blocks and templates",
  "@guideOrganizeTitle": {
    "description": "Guide title."
  },
  "guideOrganizeLead": "Group things by context, and reuse what you do often.",
  "@guideOrganizeLead": {
    "description": "Guide lead sentence."
  },
  "guideOrganize1Title": "Lists",
  "@guideOrganize1Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideOrganize1Body": "Life Admin, Errands, and your own lists. An item can be in a list and planned for a day.",
  "@guideOrganize1Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideOrganize2Title": "Time blocks",
  "@guideOrganize2Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideOrganize2Body": "Block out time for a whole list, like Errands on Saturday morning, and it shows as one entry on Today.",
  "@guideOrganize2Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideOrganize3Title": "Templates and routines",
  "@guideOrganize3Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideOrganize3Body": "Save checklists you use again and again. Make one a routine and it arrives on its own schedule.",
  "@guideOrganize3Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideOrganize4Title": "Search",
  "@guideOrganize4Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideOrganize4Body": "Find anything, including done items, from the search icon.",
  "@guideOrganize4Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideDataTitle": "Your data and privacy",
  "@guideDataTitle": {
    "description": "Guide title."
  },
  "guideDataLead": "Clearing keeps everything on this phone.",
  "@guideDataLead": {
    "description": "Guide lead sentence."
  },
  "guideData1Title": "No account, no internet",
  "@guideData1Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideData1Body": "There’s no server and no tracking; the app can’t reach the internet at all.",
  "@guideData1Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideData2Title": "Backups",
  "@guideData2Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideData2Body": "Export a copy in Settings › Backup, and restore it on any phone.",
  "@guideData2Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideData3Title": "Moving phones",
  "@guideData3Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideData3Body": "Android’s phone-to-phone transfer brings Clearing’s data along, or use a backup.",
  "@guideData3Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
  "guideData4Title": "Trash and archive",
  "@guideData4Title": {
    "description": "Guide point heading."
  },
  "guideData4Body": "Deleted items stay in Trash for 30 days; done items move to the archive and stay searchable.",
  "@guideData4Body": {
    "description": "Guide point text."
  },
